<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93554" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σειραῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σειρά</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>joined by a cord</i> or
			<i>band</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππος ς.</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σειραφόρος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				722
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσὶ γὰρ ἵπποις . . τρίτος παρείπετο ς
					. . . ῥυτῆρσι συνεχόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					7.73
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῶτα σειραίον</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππου</span>) cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σειρίου</span> in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				779.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἱμάς</span> the
			<i>attaching</i> trace of the horse, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.148
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσειραῖος</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of cord, twisted</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρόχοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					1009
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήρινθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					241
				</span></i>
			.</div>
